eparate trick.**\n\n---\n\n### **Trick 3: The Card Manipulation / Card Production (Frames 26–30)**\n\n- **Frames 26–30**: David Blaine is now holding a deck of cards and appears to be performing sleight of hand. He shuffles, fans, and manipulates the cards while Jimmy Fallon watches intently. This is a different physical routine — not involving the audience reveal, but focused on close-up card manipulation.\n- **Verification**:\n  1. ✅ David Blaine is performing.\n  2. ✅ Cards are clearly visible and being manipulated.\n  3. ✅ On the Tonight Show stage.\n  4. ✅ Formal TV studio environment.\n  5. ✅ Jimmy Fallon is watching, and by context (audience shots earlier), the studio audience is present.\n  6. ✅ Cards are being manipulated magically (sleight of hand, fanning, possible production or vanish — though the exact effect isn’t fully revealed in these frames, the intent and context indicate a magical manipulation).\n\n→ **This is a second distinct card trick.**\n\n---\n\n### **Other Frames:**\n\n- **Frames 1–3, 23–25**: No cards visible or being used. Frame 23–25 show Questlove with a card, but it’s not part of a trick — he’s just holding it, possibly as a participant or spectator. No magical manipulation or performance context is evident.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Final Count: 2 distinct magic tricks with playing cards performed on stage.**\n\n---\n\n**Answer: 2**'}, {'batch_start': 300, 'batch_end': 330, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1527.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1528.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1529.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1530.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1531.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1532.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1533.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_