\n3. **Mass‑audience reveal / prediction series (Priyanka, Questlove, audience)**  \n4. **Nail‑through‑card gag with Zachary\u202fLevi**\n\nThe later “prediction”, “levitation”, and “vanish” shots are variations or extensions of routine\u202f3, while the final vanishing act is the concluding flourish of that same routine. Therefore, the episode showcases **four distinct card‑magic tricks** performed on stage, with a cast that includes Jimmy\u202fFallon, David\u202fBlaine, The Roots (Questlove), guests Priyanka\u202fChopra, Zachary\u202fLevi, and occasional backstage/on‑stage audience members.', 'failed_images': []}
