ly.\n- **Magical manipulation**: Blaine is performing sleight-of-hand, likely a card vanish or transformation, as the group reacts with surprise and amusement.\n\n→ **This qualifies as one complete card trick.**\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Trick 2: The Card Selection & Revelation with Jimmy Fallon & Priyanka Chopra (Frames 9–30)**\n\nThis sequence is a continuous, clearly demarcated performance segment.\n\n- **Performer**: David Blaine (in black shirt) is performing a card trick for Jimmy Fallon and Priyanka Chopra.\n- **Cards visible**: Blaine holds a deck, fans it (Frame 15), and later reveals a selected card (Jack of Clubs, Frames 23–27).\n- **Stage/Performance Area**: The Tonight Show set, with desk, city skyline backdrop, and studio lighting.\n- **Formal Performance Environment**: TV studio with host and celebrity guest participating.\n- **Multiple people watching**: Jimmy Fallon, Priyanka Chopra, and likely off-screen audience (implied by setting and reactions).\n- **Magical manipulation**: Blaine performs a classic card selection and revelation. The card is shown to Fallon (Frames 28–30), who reacts with amazement — indicating a magical outcome.\n\n→ **This qualifies as a second distinct card trick.**\n\n---\n\n### ❌ Why not more?\n\n- No other frames show a *complete* card trick with all six criteria met.\n- Some frames show card handling but not a full trick (e.g., no clear magical outcome or audience reaction).\n- No temporal gaps or clear transitions indicate a third trick within these 30 frames.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ Final Count: **2 distinct card magic tricks performed on stage**\n\n---'}, {'batch_start': 210, 'batch_end': 240, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1086.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1087.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1088.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1089.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/vide