. Jimmy appears to be either recovering from a trick or participating in a post-trick moment.\n- There’s **no visible magical manipulation** — it looks like aftermath or setup, not a trick in progress.\n- **No clear performer executing a trick** — David Blaine is not visible here performing.\n\n❌ **Fails criteria 1 and 6**: No clear performer actively doing magic, and no magical manipulation is shown.\n\n→ **Not counted as a distinct card trick.**\n\n---\n\n#### **Trick 3: Post-Trick Discussion / Audience Reaction (Frames 20–30)**\n\n- **Frames 20–21**: Backstage/audience area — not on stage, no cards visible.\n- **Frames 22–27**: David Blaine and Jimmy Fallon sitting at the desk, discussing the trick. On-screen text reads: “David Blaine Freaks Jimmy Out with a Terrifying Card and Nail Trick” — this confirms the trick shown earlier (Trick 1) is being discussed.\n- **Frames 28–30**: Audience shots — reacting to the trick, but no performance or card manipulation occurring.\n\n❌ **Fails criteria 1, 2, 3, and 6**: No active trick being performed, no cards being manipulated magically, not on stage in performance mode.\n\n→ **Not counted as a distinct card trick.**\n\n---\n\n### **Conclusion:**\n\nOnly **one** distinct card magic trick meets all six criteria and is fully performed on stage within these 30 frames.\n\n---\n\n**✅ Final Answer: 1**'}, {'batch_start': 270, 'batch_end': 300, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1324.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1325.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1326.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1338.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1339.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1340.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYBvA/frames/frame_1341.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/k2FIFQIYB